AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; 2026-10-13 sync -- media-loading-pseudo-classes-in-has.sub.html.ini resolved to upstream's (#48802 dropped its subtest expectations); the QuickJS conditions are regenerated from this sync's QuickJS WPT run)
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; 2026-10-13 sync -- added the rerun rule to runbook step 3.8, the method this sync used for the update above; this commit's own runbook lines, which the sync's fold had moved into the first commit, are back here)
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; 2026-10-22 sync -- three files resolved to upstream's: the top-level-document subtest of autoplay-default-permissions-policy and resource-selection-candidate-moved now fail with SpiderMonkey too (upstream expectations), and upstream deleted multisampled-stencil-renderbuffer-initialization.html.ini (#48972); the QuickJS conditions are regenerated from this sync's QuickJS WPT run)
